flowchart TB
    Website[Website requests permission] --> Chromium[Chromium request]
    Chromium --> Manager[PermissionManager]
    Manager --> Stored{Stored site decision?}
    Stored -->|Yes| Decision[Apply profile + origin decision]
    Stored -->|No| Prompt[PHNX permission prompt]
    Prompt --> User{User choice}
    User --> Allow[Allow, if Android also permits]
    User --> Block[Block]
    Allow --> Save[Save by profile + origin + type]
    Block --> Save
    Android[Android runtime permission] --> Allow
    Android --> Block

